2 CONT -Ramsay, Jully: Frälsesläkter i Finland Intill Stora Ofreden, p. 375-376. =>  http://runeberg.org/frfinl/0393.html
2 CONT
2 CONT  Philip von Sass was not a son of Henrik senior d. 1658 (and Elin Slang). Henrik sr. was son of Jürgen von Sass (mentioned 1597 - 1605, unknown wife) son of Reinhold von Sass to Sassenhof, d.28.10.1560 wife NN Tödwen. Philip von S
2 CONC ass was possibly grandson of Reinhold and cousin of Henrik sr. as both of them were involved in a court case concerning Sassenhof. Philip von Sass' father is not known.   The ancestors of both Henrik senior and Philip von Sass sho
2 CONC uld be changed accordingly. (see further Ättartavlor by Tor Carpelan 1965)
