2 CONT Service record SWEDEN, JAMES SPENS Arrived 1624-01-01, as CAPTAIN Departed 1632-12-31, as OFFICER Capacity OFFICER, purpose MILITARY SWEDEN, ABO AREA INFANTRY REGIMENT, FINLAND Arrived 1632-01-01, as MAJOR Departed 1635-12-31, as 
2 CONC MAJOR Capacity OFFICER, purpose MILITARY SWEDEN, PATRICK OGILVIE'S VIBORG REGIMENT Arrived 1636-01-01, as MAJOR Departed 1666-12-31, as COLONEL + CHIEF Capacity OFFICER, purpose MILITARY SWEDEN, RIGA CASTLE Arrived 1657-01-01, as 
2 CONC GOVERNOR Departed 1657-12-31, as GOVERNOR Capacity GOVERNOR, purpose MILITARY SWEDEN, KEXHOLM Arrived 1660-01-01, as GOVERNOR Departed 1674-12-31, as GOVERNOR Capacity GOVERNOR, purpose CIVIC "
