1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == WILLIAM OGILVIE OF BALGAY ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Name:	Ogilvie, William
2 CONT Dates:	14 Feb 1565
2 CONT Place:	Inchemartyne, West Lothian, Scotland
2 CONT Book:	Mort Roll from 1781 in the Register House, Edinburgh. (Death)
2 CONT Collection:	West Lothian, and Midlothian; Gloucestershire: Edinburgh; Bristol- Commissariot Record of Edinburgh, Register of Testaments, 1514-1600; Bristol Wills, 1572-1792
2 CONT Volume:	The Commissarint Record of Edinburgh.
2 CONT Chapter:	Register of Testaments. First Section--1514-1600. Edited by Francis J. Grant, W.S., Carrick Pursuivant of Arms.
2 CONT Text:	Ogilvie, '''William, of Inchemartyne''' 14 Feb 1565 and 26 Nov 1573
2 CONT Ancestry.com. UK, Extracted Probate Records, 1269-1975 [database on-line]. Provo, UT, USA: Ancestry.com Operations Inc, 2009.
2 CONT
2 CONT /////
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Ogilwie_nr_277 '''William Ogilwie''']. Gick i svensk tjänst. Erhöll förlåning i Sverige av [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Posse_nr_14#TAB_11 '''Göran Nilsson Posses'''] år 1599 förbrutn
2 CONC a gods. Död före 1613. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gift 1:o''' med '''Elisabet Langlands''', dotter av Patrik Patriksson Langlands, länsherre av Collare, och Joneta Williamsdotter Scott av Craighall. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gift 2:o''' med '''Barbara Kinnaird''' i hennes 1:a gifte (gift 2:o med översten Samuel Cockburn, av skotsk adel, född 1574, död 1621 i Åbo och begraven i domkyrkan därst. 1622 under ett ståtligt, ännu bevarat monument). Hon fi
2 CONC ck 1613-04-25 Selkis och Sarkkola i Karkku socken i vederlag för hennes mans donation i Sverige, vilken nu återskänkts till Göran Posses dotter.
2 CONT
2 CONT /////
2 CONT
2 CONT His son Patrick Ogilvie's (Ogilwie in Sweden) testimony of descendance including his father William Ogilvie of Inchmartine, produced from Scotland to the swedish king's officials when he applied for his naturalisation in the swedi
2 CONC sh peerage. This was witnessed  by several highranking scottish officers that were employed in Sweden in the king's army at the same time.  He was accepted and went in to great achievements and owned many properties in Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT "Patricii Ogiluie Vice - Collonelli praedicti Nativitatis Legitimae et Ingenuitatis Testimonium fidele daremus, Praesertim cum omnibus pene (eller "sene"?) Nostratibus constaret '''Patricium Ogiluie Vice-Colonellum praedicutm legi
2 CONC time natum, baptizatum et educatum, Nec non ex generosis et ingenuis parentibus Sancto Matrimonii Vinculo coram veneranda Ecclesia junctis legittime procreatum fuisse, Patre nimirum qvondam Willielmo Ogiluie de Balgaÿ ex domu de I
