1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MML [https://asiointi.maanmittauslaitos.fi/karttapaikka/?share=customMarker&n=6769708.494&e=415481.464&title=Hollola%2C%20vanha%20pappila&desc=&zoom=10&layers=%5B%7B%22id%22%3A2%2C%22opacity%22%3A100%7D%5D Hollolan
