2 CONT The below mentioned Elizabeth Monorgund might be the same as in this profile, or a close relative at least.
2 CONT I have added this information here, because it is hard to come by information of this specific family as it is a very rare one.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://atrium.lib.uoguelph.ca/xmlui/handle/10214/26962
2 CONT '''
2 CONT Protocol Book of the Burgh of Dundee, 3rd September 1518 to July 1584'''
2 CONT Fol 3 & Fol 4:
2 CONT ..."The 3 rd day of November. In the Tolbooth of Dundee, at the 11 th hour. Present Mr Charle
2 CONT Fotheringham, John Rollock, David Rollock, Thomas Carale; anent instruments of
2 CONT protestations of Alexander Ogilvy of that Ilk, against the charters and evidents, of the
2 CONT late David Arbuthnot of Legislandis.
2 CONT The same day, the first hour: present Mr James Dugud, Sir Robert Lam, David
2 CONT Fotheringham, Thomas Fauld, Patrick Reche, concerning the resignation of conjunct fee,
2 CONT by earth and stone, in the hands of Mr David Carale, bailie, given by Elizabeth
2 CONT Monorgund, and that whole fore land lying on the south side of the Murraygate
2 CONT between the land of Christina Farquhar on the east, and the land of St Paul on the west,
2 CONT and the land of the heirs of the late David wedderburn on the south: the bailie gave
2 CONT seizing thereof to Robert Nyll, for five merks of annual rent to be paid to the said
2 CONT Elizabeth.
2 CONT Fol:4 The said Robert resigned by a penny five merks of annual rent of all and whole the
2 CONT aforesaid land, in the hands of the said bailie, who gave seizing in liferent of the same to
2 CONT the said Elizabeth Monorgund, and promised and obliged himself, his heirs and his
2 CONT goods if it should happen the said land not be distrainable for the said annual rent, that
2 CONT it should be lawful to the said Elizabeth or the officer of the law to poind and distrain the
2 CONT good thereof in whatsoever place for the annual relt or any part thereof."...
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fdca.org.uk/pdf%20files/Town%20Clerks%20Protocol%20Book%203rd%20September%201518%20to%20July%201584%20(A).pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Monorgan of that Ilk:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://shop.fmg.ac/library/4613-monorgan-of-that-ilk-part-one
2 CONT
