2 CONT
2 CONT ..."Patricii Ogiluie Vice - Collonelli praedicti Nativitatis Legitimae et Ingenuitatis Testimonium fidele daremus, Praesertim cum omnibus pene (eller "sene"?) Nostratibus constaret Patricium Ogiluie Vice-Colonellum praedicutm legi
2 CONC time natum, baptizatum et educatum, Nec non ex generosis et ingenuis parentibus Sancto Matrimonii Vinculo coram veneranda Ecclesia junctis legittime procreatum fuisse, Patre nimirum qvondam Willielmo Ogiluie de Balgaÿ ex domu de I
2 CONC nchmartine et Matre quondam Elizabetha LangLands filia domini de Collace intra Vice-Comitatum praescriptum, Ac etiam ex parte Patris Auia Monorgund de eodem, Proavia Haÿ de Meginch, et Mater sui Avi Rosse de Cragie, Et similiter e
2 CONC x parte Matris Auia Scot de Balwerie Mater suae Auiae Aito ne de eodem, Ac Mater sui Aui Wishert de Logie. Propterea Nobilissimus et Potentissimus Comes Joannes Comes de Perth Dominus Drummound et Stobhall, Nec non Nobilissimus et
2 CONC  Potentissimus Comes Joannes Comes de Kingorne, Dominus Lyon et Glames, Nec non Nobillissimus et Potentissimus Comes Jacobus Comes de "Finlatore" Dominus Deffurd, Nec non Nobilissimus Dominus Patricius dominus de Deffurd: Nec non 
2 CONC Honorabiles et Potentes domini Dominus Patricius Ogilui de Inchmartine Dominus Thomas Blaire de Balthyoke, Virigraues et generosi Coram Nobis pro dicto tribunali praesentes Juramento adacti et axaminati, de more elatis Brachüs exp
2 CONC ansis manibus et in coelum erectis digitis":....
2 CONT
2 CONT Patricii Ogiluie Vice - Collonelli praedicti Nativitatis Legitimae et Ingenuitatis Testimonium fidele daremus, Praesertim cum omnibus pene (eller "sene"?) coram veneranda Ecclesia junctis legittime procreatum fuisse, Patre nimirum
2 CONC  qvondam Willielmo Ogiluie de Balgaÿ ex domu de Inchmartine et Matre quondam Elizabetha LangLands filia domini de Collace intra Vice-Comitatum praescriptum, Ac etiam ex parte Patris Auia Monorgin de Haodem, Mater sui Avi Rosse de 
2 CONC Cragie, Et similiter ex parte Matris Auia Scot de Balwerie Mater suae Auiae Aito ne de eodem, Ac Mater sui Aui Wishert de Logie. Propterea Nobilissimus et Potentissimus Comes Joannes Comes de Perth Dominus Drummound et Stobhall, N
2 CONC ec non Nobilissimus et Potentissimus Comes Joannes Comes de Kingorne, Dominus Lyon et Glames, Nec non Nobillissimus et Potentissimus Comes Jacobus Comes de "Finlatore" Dominus Noffus Dominic Deff dominus de Deffurd: Nec non Honora
2 CONC biles et Potentes domini Dominus Patricius Ogilui de Inchmartine Dominus Thomas Blaire de Balthyoke, Virigraues et generosi Coram Nobis pro dicto tribunali preesentes Juramento adacti et axaminati, de more elatis Brachüs expansis 
2 CONC manibus et in coelum er: " ..
2 CONT
2 CONT == Google Translate: Latin to English , mind that the text gets transformed in transkation so it cannot applied as such, this is only for giving a roundabout understanding of what it says,not for literal transcript==
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick Ogiluie Vice - Collonelli was legitimately born as a legitimate and noble witness to the aforesaid Christmas, especially since almost everyone (eller "old"?) was legitimately born before the venerable Church, the daughter 
2 CONC of the late Elizabeth Langlands. Lord de Collace within the prescription . Therefore the Most Noble and Most Powerful Count John Earl of Perth Lord Drummound and Stobhall The Honorable and Powerful Lord Patrick Ogilui of Inchmarti
2 CONC ne The Lord Thomas Blaire of Balthyoke, Virgraues and Gentlemen, present before us before the said tribunal an oath administered and examined, according to the custom of raising Brachus with outstretched hands and into heaven
2 CONT
2 CONT =OBSERVE! On wikitree this person's profile is completely wrong.= 
2 CONT =Not all information related to these lines on wikitree are correct.  There are faults amongst others with Patrick Ogilvie's paternal side, where he should have a paternal grandmother called Besseta aka Elizabeth Monargund (the pe
2 CONC rson of this profile right here) there now stands a completely other person unknown to this line. I am assuming it is because the Monargund line is extremely elusive so for some reason thry have put an entirely different Elspeth n
2 CONC ot belonging to this family at all on the Wikitree lines, but after years of searching and searching I have found some information about the Monargunds too and there indeed has been a Bessie or Elspeth Monargund which appears in m
2 CONC any different written forms as at the time names and many words hadn't yet gotten a standardised writing form. (again scots' way of writing the same name and Bessie and Besseta are both nicknames for Elizabeth and Monargund appear
2 CONC s nowadays as Monorgan, which is a location near the city of modern Dundee, but has appeared in the records even as Monorgund, Monorgounde etc.) =  
2 CONT
