1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * '''Tönnes Maydell''', who came from a German-Baltic noble dynasty that had lived in Etsonia for centuries, was a cavalry captain in fieldmarshall Gustav Horn's regiment and owned Wredenhagen and Sompah estates in
2 CONC  Jewe, Estonia and died before 1657.
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Maydell_nr_102#TAB_2
2 CONT
2 CONT * Tönnes Maydell till Wredenhagen samt Sompäh i Jewe socken i Estland. Ryttmästare vid fältmarskalken Gust. Horns regemente. Död före 1657. (Medd. av baron m. Stackelberg, Reval.) Elgenstierna.
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://sok.riksarkivet.se/Sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=9202
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://personen.digitale-sammlungen.de/baltlex/Blatt_bsb00000602,00556.html?prozent=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Maydell, von u. Barone; EAA.1674.2.136: [https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1674.2.136:6?311,326,957,1239,0 Saaga EAA.1674.2.136:6?311,326,957,1239,0]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Päris isa Jürgen/Georg Maydelli Maidla Wredenhagen mõisa 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Genos 2024:3 s. 186-188.
