1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Dj%C3%A4kn,_Lydikas%C3%B6nernas_%C3%A4tt#TAB_6 '''Estrid Lydiksdotter''']. Var gift 1559 (Got ''married'' in 1559). 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Möjligen var''' hennes son den Lydik Matsson i Kråkö, som 1569 gör ett jordskifte med Mårten Mattsson (Creutz) och då uppger denne vara sin mors systerson.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Her son''' possibly was the Lydik Matsson i Kråkö, Porvoo, Finland, who, in 1569 traded property with Mårten Mattsson (Creutz) who, then, appears to have been her mother's sister's son (nephew). 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Please see''' the sister's (Bengta) profile. As well as the spouse's. Was "Matts" perhaps Matts Larsson (Creutz) or Matts Knutsson (Creutz)?
2 CONT
2 CONT /////
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://runeberg.org/frfinl/0253.html '''Estrid Lydiksdotter'''], lefde 1559 (Was ''alive'' in 1559).  "Gift till Kråkö med Matts och hade sonen Lydik Mattsson", som 1570 sålde sin arf jord i Kråkö till sitt syskon barn, Mårten Ma
2 CONC ttsson (Creutz). 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Was alive''' in 1559. Married in Kråkö with Matts and had a son, Lydik Matsson who, in 1570, sold his inherited property in Kråkö to to his sister's child (nephew), Mårten Mattsson (Creutz). <br/>
2 CONT <br/>
