2 CONT * Syskon:	Claes Thegner, Olof Thegner
2 CONT * Maka:	Maria Magdalena Thegner (born Leijonmarck)
2 CONT * Barn:	Maria Charlotta Trafvenfelt, Friherrina (born Tegner), Gustava Elisabet Thegner, Fredrika Eleonora Thegner, Anna Judith Tegner
