2 CONT * [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/A0064508_00006#?xywh=1438%2C1702%2C5563%2C2430&cv=5 1612] - teenis ratsanikuna Frommhold von Patkuli kompaniis.
2 CONT *[https://books.google.ee/books?id=oQlBAAAAYAAJ&dq=%22bernd%20taube%22&hl=et&pg=PA115#v=onepage&q=%22bernd%20taube%22&f=false 17.01.1618] - Paide, rittmeister Bernd Taube kirjutas Gabriel Oxenstiernale ja Adam Schrapferile. Ei ole
2 CONC  100% kindel, et sama isik.
2 CONT ===1620. aastad===
2 CONT *[https://books.google.ee/books?id=B5ZpAAAAcAAJ&lpg=PA328&ots=NSafn4Gf9l&dq=%22taube%20von%20der%20isen%22&hl=et&pg=PA298#v=onepage&q=eissen&f=false 12.02.1621] - üks tunnistajatest Peter Taube ja Axel Oxenstierna vahelisele Püha 
2 CONC ja Ruila mõisa müügilepingule.
2 CONT *[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/A0053582_00026#?c=&m=&s=&cv=25&xywh=1788%2C-338%2C4917%2C2755 1622] [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/A0053006_00020#?c=&m=&s=&cv=19&xywh=-98%2C2197%2C4097%2C2295 2] - ühe ratsaväekom
2 CONC panii rittmeister. Pigem polnud tema, vaid Berend Taube Maidlast.
